      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your concern is valid; the term \"narrowly tailored\" doesn't always protect against abuse of power if not properly checked. It's crucial for democratic oversight, with judicious legal standards and checks and balances to prevent misuse. An inclusive dialogue between civil society, policymakers, and international bodies can help ensure that measures aimed at security are not misused to suppress dissent. Transparency and accountability mechanisms must be robust enough to make overreach evident and actionable.",
